    firox-control-panel display    open Display directly
    firox-control-panel background open Desktop Background directly
    firox-control-panel appearance open Appearance directly
    firox-control-panel power      open Power Options directly
    firox-control-panel screensaver open Screen Saver directly
    firox-control-panel clipboard  open Clipboard directly
    firox-control-panel mouse      open Mouse (and touchpad) directly
    firox-control-panel keyboard   open Keyboard directly
    firox-control-panel accounts   open User Accounts directly
    firox-control-panel taskbar    open Taskbar directly
    firox-control-panel defaults   open Default Programs directly
"""

